            "\\vspace{-.1em}\n",
            "\\paragraph{Other Details.}\n",
            "We use $k=16$ examples as demonstrations by default for all experiments in the paper, unless otherwise specified.\n",
            "Examples are sampled at uniform from the training data.\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "We choose a set of $k$ training examples using 5 different random seeds and run experiments 5 times.\n",
            "For fairseq 13B and GPT-3, due to limited resources, we experiment with a subset of 6 datasets\\footnote{\n",
