            "We refer to Appendix~\\ref{app:exp-details} for more details. All experiments are reproducible from \\href{https://github.com/Alrope123/rethinking-demonstrations}{\\nolinkurl{github.com/Alrope123/rethinking-demonstrations}}.\n",
