            "\n",
            "We identify four aspects of the \\demo\\ $(x_1, y_1)...(x_k, y_k)$ that potentially provide learning signal (depicted in Figure~\\ref{fig:composition}).\n",
            "\n",
            "\\begin{enumerate}[itemsep=0em]\n",
